WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500 line:55%
Disconnect power and insert the SIM first.

00:02.500 --> 00:11.000 line:55%
Stack from bottom to top:
AV06 → AC09 → AX04 → AP03B → AZ01C → AI05.

00:11.000 --> 00:14.000 line:55%
Align the bus contacts and screw holes.
Check orientation and clearance.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000 line:55%
Insert two M2×18mm screws
through to the AZ63 Nut Plate at the bottom.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000 line:55%
Tighten the two screws alternately
to keep the stack even.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000 line:55%
Assembly complete.
Try environmental sensing and cellular communication.
